---
// Static take on the live site's "Visual Analysis" 3D comparison.
---
<figure class="card overflow-hidden">
  <figcaption class="border-b border-line px-6 py-4">
    <span class="text-[0.7rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold-deep">Visual Analysis</span>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed">Compare the smooth, uniform structure of a benign mole against the chaotic, irregular growth of a melanoma.</p>
  </figcaption>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 divide-x divide-line">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center px-4 py-8 text-center">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" class="h-32 w-32" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="56" fill="#f1dfcf" />
        <ellipse cx="60" cy="60" rx="26" ry="25" fill="#6b4c3a" />
        <ellipse cx="54" cy="53" rx="8" ry="5" fill="#8a6750" opacity=".6" />
      </svg>
      <p class="mt-4 font-serif text-lg text-ink">Benign Mole</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-emerald-700">Uniform • Symmetrical</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center px-4 py-8 text-center">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" class="h-32 w-32" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="56" fill="#f1dfcf" />
        <path d="M36 58c-4-14 8-26 20-24 6-8 20-6 24 4 12 2 16 16 8 24 6 12-6 24-18 20-8 8-22 4-24-6-12 0-16-12-10-18z" fill="#4a3226" />
        <path d="M52 48c6-4 14 0 12 8-4 6-14 4-12-8z" fill="#1c1210" />
        <path d="M70 66c6 0 10 6 6 10-6 2-10-4-6-10z" fill="#7a2a24" />
        <path d="M44 70c4-2 8 2 6 6-4 2-8-2-6-6z" fill="#a37a5c" />
      </svg>
      <p class="mt-4 font-serif text-lg text-ink">Melanoma</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-red-700">Irregular • Multi-color</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</figure>
